      <h1>Green Shield Coverage for Wellness Care <em>Paramedical Benefits, Claims and Spending Accounts</em></h1>
      <p>This guide explains how Green Shield group benefits usually treat the wellness care listed on WellFinder, including physiotherapy, massage therapy and osteopathy. It covers claiming through GreenShield+, direct billing through providers, and the spending accounts many Green Shield plans include.</p>
      <p>Green Shield Canada describes itself as a social enterprise and the only national benefits provider in Canada organized on a not for profit basis. Its plans still work the way other group plans work in one respect: your employer chose your categories and amounts, so confirm them in your own account before you book.</p>
      <p class="byline">By WellFinder · November 2026 · 5 min read</p>
    </div>
      </div>

  </section>

